        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>TC600 Series Door Closer Drop Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nUse on doors with narrow top door frames and doors with glass, when the glass interferes with closer mounting. Often used on metal framed glass store front doors. Also used to lower a door closer up to 1-1/2\".  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with Global Door Controls TC600 Series Door Closers: <a href=\"/products/grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer-global-tc612\"><b>TC612</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-grade-1-tri-packed-door-closer-global-tc611\"><b>TC611</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DP-1006-dimensions.jpg?v=1704442271\" width=\"600\" height=\"225\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DP-1006 drop plate dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global DP-1006 Drop Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 11-3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with installation screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually.</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><b>**Item Discontinued. Use <a href=\"/products/parallel-arm-drop-plate-for-american-eagle-5100-pdq-519018\">PDQ 519018 Drop Plate</a></b></p>\r\n\r\n<br><br>",
